OL,3,GNEWSAThe poetry workshop encouraging
OL,4,Ablack men to open up
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking candidly on mental health and
OL,7,Fmasculinity is challenging for many
OL,8,Fmen, but this poetry workshop is
OL,9,Fchanging that.
OL,11,FNestled away in Brixton, south London,
OL,12,FI joined the Mandem, Let's Talk
OL,13,Fprogramme every Monday for four weeks
OL,14,Fto understand the issues facing young
OL,15,Fblack men today.
OL,17,F"Going to spaces like this where you
OL,18,Fcan allow yourself to be vulnerable,
OL,19,Fyou can feel yourself growing and
OL,20,Fevolving as a person and how that will
OL,21,Finfluence you as a man moving forward,"
OL,22,Fattendee Dizo said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
