OL,3,GNEWSAThe poetry workshop encouraging
OL,4,Ablack men to open up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe programme is run by black-led
OL,7,Fcharity Poetic Unity and is designed to
OL,8,Fhelp attendees express their emotions
OL,9,Fand build confidence through spoken
OL,10,Fword.
